--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
|   0 | SELECT STATEMENT   |        |     1 |    125 | 45231   (1)| 00:01:23 |
|*  1 |  TABLE ACCESS FULL | ORDERS |     1 |    125 | 45231   (1)| 00:01:23 |
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Predicate Information (identified by operation id):
---------------------------------------------------
   1 - filter("O"."CUSTOMER_ID"=42 AND
              "O"."ORDER_DATE">TO_DATE(' 2024-01-01 00:00:00',
              'syyyy-mm-dd hh24:mi:ss'))

Note
-----
   - Full table scan on ORDERS table (1,500,000 rows, 25,000 blocks)
